 "provenance": {
  "source": "github.com/rodecomp/rodecomp @ bb34313a3bb2e0ee12cb2516634b6d920a39838d - CSession::GetSkillActionInfo / GetSkillActionInfo2 explicit `motion = N` cases",
  "note": "The official client calls SetState(motion) after a skill use; motion is an ACTORSTATEID. The default motion is ST_BEGIN_SKILL (8) in GetSkillActionInfo and ST_SKILL (7) in GetSkillActionInfo2, so only skills that override it explicitly are listed here. This is the cast/use pose of the caster, not the attack animation of the skill (that comes from the attack/damage path). Motions without an entry in the ACTORSTATEID enum of the decompilation (46, 49, 50, 51) are kept with a null state name."
 },
